00:23:18.797 --> 00:23:20.899
WESTERN PENNSYLVANIA WITH HIS

00:23:20.966 --> 00:23:22.501
TWO SIBLINGS. THEY LIVED NEXT

00:23:22.567 --> 00:23:24.002
DOOR TO HIS MATERNAL

00:23:24.069 --> 00:23:25.737
GRANDPARENTS IN A SMALL HOUSE

00:23:25.804 --> 00:23:28.073
WITH A SHARED OUTHOUSE. I'M SURE

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:29.141
YOU DIDN'T REALLY WANT ME TO

00:23:29.207 --> 00:23:31.076
TELL THEM THAT, BUT IT SPEAKS TO

00:23:31.143 --> 00:23:33.345
HIS HUMILITY AND HIS DEDICATION

00:23:33.411 --> 00:23:36.681
IN THE LIFE HE CHOSE TO LEAD.

00:23:36.748 --> 00:23:38.650
BUT IT WASN'T UNTIL HIS FAMILY

00:23:38.717 --> 00:23:39.751
MOVED TO FLORIDA IN HIS TEENS

00:23:39.818 --> 00:23:41.620
THAT HE WAS INTRODUCED TO ANYONE

00:23:41.686 --> 00:23:42.788
WHO'D GONE TO COLLEGE, AND THAT

00:23:42.854 --> 00:23:44.723
GOT HIM THINKING THAT PERHAPS

00:23:44.790 --> 00:23:46.591
HE, TOO, COULD GET A DEGREE. BOB

00:23:46.658 --> 00:23:48.827
WENT ON TO EARN A BACHELOR'S IN

00:23:48.894 --> 00:23:50.328
SPEECH AND ENGLISH FROM TREVECCA

00:23:50.395 --> 00:23:51.329
NAZARENE UNIVERSITY, A MASTER'S

00:23:51.396 --> 00:23:53.231
IN COMMUNICATION FROM THE

00:23:53.298 --> 00:23:56.168
UNIVERSITY OF CINCINNATI, AND A

00:23:56.234 --> 00:23:57.169
PH.D. IN ORGANIZATIONAL AND

00:23:57.235 --> 00:23:59.304
INTERPERSONAL COMMUNICATION FROM

00:23:59.371 --> 00:24:02.274
THE UNIVERSITY OF KANSAS. PRIOR

00:24:02.340 --> 00:24:03.341
