00:50:23.520 --> 00:50:25.489
CALIFORNIA AND THE COUNTRY BY

00:50:25.555 --> 00:50:26.656
STORM, ENJOYED BY THE YOUNG AND

00:50:26.723 --> 00:50:29.092
THE YOUNG AT HEART. PICKLEBALL

00:50:29.159 --> 00:50:31.027
FULFILLS THE INTENTION OF THE

00:50:31.094 --> 00:50:32.729
INVENTORS BY CREATING A GAME

00:50:32.796 --> 00:50:35.165
THAT THE WHOLE FAMILY CAN COME

00:50:35.232 --> 00:50:37.234
TOGETHER AND ENJOY, REGARDLESS

00:50:37.300 --> 00:50:40.203
OF AGE OR ABILITY. PICKLEBALL

00:50:40.270 --> 00:50:41.271
WAS INVENTED IN 1965, IN

00:50:41.338 --> 00:50:44.241
WASHINGTON BY JOE PRITCHARD, A

00:50:44.307 --> 00:50:46.376
CONGRESSMAN FROM WASHINGTON, AND

00:50:46.443 --> 00:50:48.945
BILL BELL, A SUCCESSFUL

00:50:49.012 --> 00:50:50.046
