00:50:50.113 --> 00:50:51.715
BATMAN ON AN OLD BADMINTON COURT

00:50:51.782 --> 00:50:54.418
BUT COULD NOT FIND THE PROPER

00:50:54.484 --> 00:50:54.885
EQUIPMENT. SINCE THEN,

00:50:54.951 --> 00:50:57.154
PICKLEBALL HAS BEEN EXPLODING IN

00:50:57.220 --> 00:50:59.723
GROWTH AND POPULARITY WITH

00:50:59.790 --> 00:51:00.724
TOURNAMENTS PLAYED BY MILLIONS

00:51:00.791 --> 00:51:03.326
RANGING FROM YOUNG TO OLD ALL

00:51:03.393 --> 00:51:06.296
AROUND THE WORLD. THE US

00:51:06.363 --> 00:51:08.165
PICKLEBALL ASSOCIATION HAS MORE

00:51:08.231 --> 00:51:09.266
THAN 40,000 MEMBERS, AND IT IS

00:51:09.332 --> 00:51:11.802
ESTIMATED THAT PICKLEBALL IS ONE

00:51:11.868 --> 00:51:13.537
OF THE FASTEST GROWING SPORTS IN

00:51:13.603 --> 00:51:15.272
THE UNITED STATES, AS

00:51:15.338 --> 00:51:17.908
PARTICIPANTS REACH OVER

00:51:17.974 --> 00:51:18.909
3,000,003.3 MILLION PEOPLE. WITH

00:51:18.975 --> 00:51:22.045
THAT, COLLEAGUES, THIS IS WHAT I

00:51:22.112 --> 00:51:25.015
CALL A SERIOUS PICKLEBALL PLAYER.

